   "note": "rate_agree/rate_differs compare the billed rate with the contract rate as a diagnostic only (billing is never the truth criterion). A line whose rate depends on the band (G4), the ground class or the well class (not evidenced; G5) has no single rate: it counts as rate_not_single, and billed_rate_is_an_admissible_alternative counts those billed at one admissible alternative's rate. rate_not_formed: no contract rate was formed (a code outside the schedules, a month outside the published tables, or the line not payable before its rate was needed). value_not_formed: the line has no value at G3 (deferred to G4, or unresolved on an input G2 left empty): no rate is compared."
  },
